---
// About section component
// Explains what Century Digital does using industry-specific language
---

<section id="about" class="w-full bg-white scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="section-inner flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
			<div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4">
				<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">
					About <span class="gradient-text">Century Digital</span>
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Century Digital is a turnkey solution for <span class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold">Independent Producers</span> and <span class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold">Financial Advisors</span> looking to cultivate a highly profitable business writing annuities.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					We understand that your time is best spent <span class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold">writing paper</span>, not chasing disconnected numbers. Our expertise and unique approach has facilitated the growth of numerous agencies achieving <span class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold">Millions in AP</span> and thousands of families protected—all while making the process a breeze for producers.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					We achieve these milestones through our signature <span class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold">ISA (Internal Sales Agent) Team</span>, who call all of your leads and set your appointments for you. No more 8 hours of dialing. No more suitability headaches from unqualified leads. Just high-intent contract owners ready to protect their principal.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">48%</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Avg Close Rate</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">41%</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Lead to Appt Rate</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">900+</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Producers Served</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">0</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Confused Leads</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="reveal">
				<div class="about-different-box bg-gradient-to-br from-[#eff6ff] to-[#dbeafe] rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 gradient-text">Why We're Different</h3>
					<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-[#1e40af]">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">No Bait and Switch:</strong> Insurance-based marketing. We don't promise free retirement guides and deliver cold leads.</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-blue-600">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">We Schedule Your Appointments:</strong> Your ISA handles the dialing. You handle the closing.</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-blue-600">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">Sales Coaching & Support:</strong> Learn from producers closing $50k+ AP monthly.</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-blue-600">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">Exclusive Leads:</strong> 100% exclusive. No other producer will ever see your leads.</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

